"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_7","text":"Again, thanks for being so cooperative.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_8","text":"Vapaus ammunition also incorporates the core of a Rapture which contains human cells, is that right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_9","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_9","text":"Yes, that's what I've heard. I don't know the details, but from what I remember...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_10","text":"It requires the core of a Rapture which has been active since the First Invasion.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_11","text":"That should be enough information to go on. We'll take care of the rest.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_12","text":"We might be able to find some if we rummage through the warehouse. Even if we can't, we can always request some from Absolute.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_13","text":"That's reassuring.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_14","text":"Speaking of Absolute, did you have a proper sendoff with them?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_15","text":"Yes. Thanks to you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_16","text":"We've got a friendly competition going on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_17","text":"We'll come out on top, but that goes without saying.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_18","text":"Hehe, a nice tactics-based competition is good, as is a healthy dose of human comradery.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_19","text":"When will the ammunition be ready?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_20","text":"That depends on when we can secure a first-generation Rapture core.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_21","text":"Even if there is some in the warehouse, it's not as if we'll be able to start manufacturing straight away. Take a break until I reach out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_22","text":"Okay, I'll wait for your message.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_23","text":"All right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_24","text":"Go ahead and get some rest.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_25","text":"By the way, I cleaned up the Outpost.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_26","text":"I figured it wouldn't be ideal coming back to a messy house after being away for so long.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_27","text":"Oh, wow! I didn't know you had it in you, Instructor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_28","text":"That's why she's the Boss!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_29","text":"Thank you, Instructor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_30","text":"I should be the one thanking you all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35bf_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35bf_04_31","text":"You're invaluable allies, and I thank you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}